### ============================================================================
### LEMBAR PANTAU — Koleksi Permintaan REST API (Fase 2)
### Base URL: http://127.0.0.1:8000/api
### ============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000/api
@token = GANTI_DENGAN_BEARER_TOKEN_HASIL_LOGIN

### 0. Pemeriksaan Kesehatan Layanan (Publik)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json

### 1a. Login sebagai Admin (melihat nama asli pangkalan)
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@bintankab.go.id",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### 1b. Login sebagai Petugas Monev (hanya melihat kode P01-P30)
# @name loginPetugas
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "petugas@bintankab.go.id",
  "password": "petugas123"
}

### 2. Profil Pengguna Aktif (GET /api/me)
GET {{baseUrl}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### 3a. Ringkasan Keseluruhan Jan-Okt 2026 (GET /api/ringkasan)
GET {{baseUrl}}/ringkasan
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### 3b. Ringkasan Bulan Tertentu — Misal September / Bulan 9 (GET /api/ringkasan?bulan=9)
GET {{baseUrl}}/ringkasan?bulan=9
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### 4a. Daftar Prioritas Pemeriksaan Pangkalan (GET /api/prioritas)
GET {{baseUrl}}/prioritas
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### 4b. Daftar Prioritas dengan Filter Bulan, Kategori, Pencarian, dan Urutan
GET {{baseUrl}}/prioritas?bulan=1&kategori=Sporadis&q=Bintan&sort=maks_lof_desc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### 5. Profil Lengkap Pangkalan P01 / P10 (GET /api/pangkalan/{kode})
GET {{baseUrl}}/pangkalan/P10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### 6. Matriks Heatmap Pangkalan x 10 Bulan (GET /api/heatmap)
GET {{baseUrl}}/heatmap
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### 7a. Daftar Temuan Flag Aturan (GET /api/temuan-aturan)
GET {{baseUrl}}/temuan-aturan
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### 7b. Daftar Temuan Flag Aturan Filter Jenis & Bulan
GET {{baseUrl}}/temuan-aturan?jenis=melebihi_alokasi&bulan=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### 8. Metodologi, Keterbatasan, dan Evaluasi Bab V (GET /api/metode)
GET {{baseUrl}}/metode
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### 9. Ekspor Daftar Prioritas ke CSV (GET /api/export/prioritas.csv)
GET {{baseUrl}}/export/prioritas.csv?sort=maks_lof_desc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: text/csv

### 9b. Jalankan Analisis LOF Baru via Layanan Python (POST /api/analisis/run - Khusus Admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/analisis/run
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "k": 10,
  "threshold": 1.5,
  "nama": "run-manual-k10"
}

### 10. Logout / Akhiri Sesi (POST /api/auth/logout)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
